---
// Barre du site au-dessus de la doc : mêmes rubriques que la barre de kotbo.fr (Nav.svelte de la
// landing), pour passer de la documentation au blog ou à l'accueil sans repasser par l'URL.
// Les chemins sont absolus : la doc est servie sous /docs, sur le même domaine que la landing.
const en = Astro.currentLocale === 'en';
const home = en ? '/en' : '/';
const links = en
  ? [
      { label: 'Home', href: '/en' },
      { label: 'Features', href: '/en/features' },
      { label: 'Docs', href: '/docs/en/', current: true },
      { label: 'Blog', href: '/en/blog' },
    ]
  : [
      { label: 'Accueil', href: '/' },
      { label: 'Fonctionnalités', href: '/fonctionnalites' },
      { label: 'Documentation', href: '/docs/', current: true },
      { label: 'Blog', href: '/blog' },
    ];
---

<div class="site-bar">
  <a class="site-bar__brand" href={home} aria-label={en ? 'Kotbo, home' : 'Kotbo, accueil'}>
    <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" />
    <span>Kotbo</span>
  </a>
  <nav aria-label={en ? 'Main navigation' : 'Navigation principale'}>
    {
      links.map((link) => (
        <a href={link.href} aria-current={link.current ? 'page' : undefined}>
          {link.label}
        </a>
      ))
    }
  </nav>
  <a class="site-bar__cta" href="https://dash.kotbo.fr">Dashboard</a>
</div>

<style>
  .site-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    background: #09090b;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #27272a;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .site-bar {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-bottom-color: #e4e4e7;
    color: #52525b;
  }
  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .site-bar__brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-inline-end: auto;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fafafa;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .site-bar__brand {
    color: #09090b;
  }
  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  nav a {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  nav a:hover,
  nav a[aria-current='page'] {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 12%, transparent);
    color: #fafafa;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) nav a:hover,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) nav a[aria-current='page'] {
    color: #09090b;
  }
  .site-bar__cta {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: #4f46e5;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .site-bar__cta:hover {
    background: #4338ca;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .site-bar__brand span,
    .site-bar__cta {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
